    {
      "title": "Кто-то поправил цену во второй версии прямо в SQL",
      "text": "Хэш версии пересчитался от новых данных — и больше не совпадает с `prev_hash` третьей версии.",
      "code": "[{ data: saved }] = await admin.unsafe(`select data from ${S(schema)}.log where id = $1 and rev = 2`, [d.kettle]);\nawait admin.unsafe(`update ${S(schema)}.log set data = jsonb_set(data, '{price}', '1') where id = $1 and rev = 2`, [d.kettle]);\nreturn adm.verify();",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[{ data: saved }] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> admin.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`select data from ${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.log where id = $1 and rev = 2`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [d.kettle]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> admin.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`update ${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">S</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.log set data = jsonb_set(data, '{price}', '1') where id = $1 and rev = 2`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [d.kettle]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adm.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre>",
